The host receiver connected once to the simulator's existing local Unix PTP
socket:

  /tmp/.z80pack/intelmdssim.pt

Guest files were sent in this order using `COPY :F0:ADRTRN.<ext> TO :HP:`:

  PLM 124, LST 1275, OBJ 186, SAT 194, LMP 399, LOC 143, MAP 400, HEX 56

For each transfer the observed framing was 120 zero leader bytes, exactly
the ISIS-II DIR payload length, then 120 zero trailer bytes. All leader and
trailer bytes were verified as zero. Total captured framing stream: 4697
bytes; extracted payloads: 2777 bytes. The raw framing stream was discarded
after extraction; only the exact payload artifacts are preserved.
